#: kded/service.cpp:81
msgid ""
"<p>Please help us improve KDE software by giving your approval to send some "
"basic analytics data to KDE servers.</p><p>The data is completely "
"<em>anonymous</em> and contains information about your hardware (CPU, GPU, "
"etc.), system (OS name, version, etc.) and KDE software. Thank you, your "
"consent will contribute to better KDE software in the future.</p><p><a "
"href='http://www.kde.org'>More information</a> about the data being "
"collected</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Por favor, ayúdamos a ameyorar el software KDE dándomos la to aprovación "
"pa "
"unviar dellos datos d'analítiques básiques a los sirvidores KDE.</p><p>Los "
"datos "
"son <em>anónimos</em> dafechu y contienen la información tocante al to "
"hardware (CPU, GPU, etc.), sistema (nome del SO, versión, etc.) y software "
"KDE. "
"Gracies, el to consentimientu contribuyirá a un meyor software KDE nel "
"futuru. "
"</p><p><a href='http://www.kde.org'>Más información</a> tocante a los datos "
"que se recueyen</p>"

