msgstr "Consentimientu KAnalytics"

#: kded/service.cpp:86
msgid "Yes, help improve KDE"
msgstr "Sí, ayudar a ameyorar KDE"

#: kded/service.cpp:87
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Non, gracies"

